        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="PARTIAL_SCOPE_OR_ACCEPTANCE. ServiceAreasPage uses public-catalog-api.js loadPublicServiceAreas and loadPublicCatalog. Public areas come from public-service-areas.service.js / DEMO_WORK_AREAS, not inferred map coverage. Public-policy.routes.js/public-policy-catalog.service.js exposes only approved/effective source-backed versions; absence is not approval of an invented policy. These GETs perform no command/transaction writes." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
